      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Timed Test Strategies","whyItMatters":"Different test lengths require different strategies. A 1-min sprint is not the same as a 5-min endurance test.","content":"**1-Minute Test:**\n- Go all out, max speed\n- Accept 90% accuracy\n- Focus on burst power\n- Good for measuring peak speed\n\n**3-Minute Test:**\n- 80-85% effort\n- Maintain steady rhythm\n- Accuracy target: 93%+\n- Measures sustainable speed\n\n**5-Minute Test:**\n- 70-75% effort\n- Focus on endurance\n- Accuracy target: 95%+\n- Measures real-world typing speed\n\n**Test Strategy:**\nFirst 10s: Find your rhythm\nMiddle: Maintain steady pace\nLast 30s: Push if you have energy\n\n**Tracking:** Log date, duration, WPM, accuracy, and errors.","codeExamples":[{"id":"ex1","title":"Timed Practice","description":"Practice at different durations","code":{"typing-speed":"one minute sprint go go go go go go go go go go\nthree minute pace steady and strong calm and controlled\nfive minute endurance slow and steady wins this race\nbuild up your stamina gradually over days and weeks"},"explanation":"Each line represents a different pacing strategy for different test lengths."}]}],
      quiz: { questions: [{"id":"q1","type":"mcq","question":"What accuracy target is recommended for a 5-minute typing test?","options":["85%","90%","95%","99%"],"correctAnswer":"95%","explanation":"For longer tests (5-min), aim for 95%+ accuracy with sustainable pace.","difficulty":1}], passingScore: 70 },
      cheatSheet: [{"label":"1-Min Test","value":"Max speed, 90% accuracy"},{"label":"3-Min Test","value":"Steady pace, 93% accuracy"},{"label":"5-Min Test","value":"Endurance, 95% accuracy"}]
