      id: "ts-22", number: 22, title: "Brackets and Parentheses Mastery", subtitle: "(), {}, [] and nested bracket typing", difficulty: "Intermediate", estimatedMinutes: 45, xpReward: 55, prerequisites: [], learningObjectives: ["Type all bracket pairs smoothly", "Handle deeply nested brackets", "Master bracket autocomplete patterns"], partLabel: "Part 3: Coding Typing Systems",
      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Bracket Typing System","whyItMatters":"Brackets are the most common source of syntax errors. Typing them efficiently prevents hours of debugging.","content":"**Bracket Positions:**\n- ( ): Shift + 9 / Shift + 0 — Index fingers\n- { }: Shift + [ / Shift + ] — Right pinkie\n- [ ]: Right pinkie / Right pinkie — Right pinkie\n- < >: Shift + , / Shift + . — Right pinkie\n\n**Nested Bracket Strategy:**\n1. Type the outer pair first\n2. Type the inner pair second\n3. Fill in between\n\nExample:\n`function(arr[ i + 1 ]) { }`\n→ Type `() {}` first\n→ Then fill\n\n**Common Patterns:**\n- Array: `[1, 2, 3]`\n- Object: `{ key: value }`\n- Function call: `fn(arg)`\n- Arrow: `() => {}`\n- JSX: `<Component prop={value}>`\n\n**Speed Drills:**\n- Alternating pairs: `() {} [] <> () {} [] <>`\n- Nested: `({[]})`, `[({})]`, `{[()]}`","codeExamples":[{"id":"ex1","title":"Bracket Drills","description":"Nested bracket patterns","code":{"typing-speed":"() {} [] <> () {} [] <>\n({[]}) [({})] {[()]} <{[]}>\nfunction outer() { return [1, 2, { key: (value) => value }]; }\nconst matrix = [[1, 2], [3, 4], [[5, 6], [7, 8]]];"},"explanation":"Progress from simple pairs to deeply nested real-world patterns."}]}],
      quiz: { questions: [{"id":"q1","type":"mcq","question":"Which fingers type ( and )?","options":["Pinkies","Ring fingers","Index fingers","Thumbs"],"correctAnswer":"Index fingers","explanation":"( and ) are typed with left and right index fingers (shift + 9/0).","difficulty":2}], passingScore: 70 },
      cheatSheet: [{"label":"( )","value":"Index fingers, shift + 9/0"},{"label":"{ }","value":"Right pinkie, shift + [/]"},{"label":"[ ]","value":"Right pinkie"}]
