      id: "ts-24", number: 24, title: "IDE Shortcut Typing", subtitle: "Ctrl+C/V/X/Z, Alt+Tab, multi-cursor, and navigation", difficulty: "Intermediate", estimatedMinutes: 40, xpReward: 50, prerequisites: [], learningObjectives: ["Type modifier key combinations smoothly", "Navigate IDE without mouse", "Execute multi-cursor workflows"], partLabel: "Part 3: Coding Typing Systems",
      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Modifier Key Combinations","whyItMatters":"Programming is 50% typing code and 50% navigating/manipulating it. Modifier combinations must be muscle memory.","content":"**Common Modifier Combos:**\n- Ctrl+C: Copy (left Ctrl + C)\n- Ctrl+V: Paste (left Ctrl + V)\n- Ctrl+X: Cut (left Ctrl + X)\n- Ctrl+Z: Undo\n- Ctrl+Y: Redo\n- Ctrl+S: Save\n- Ctrl+A: Select all\n- Ctrl+F: Find\n- Ctrl+H: Find and replace\n\n**Navigation Combos:**\n- Ctrl+Left/Right: Word jump\n- Ctrl+Shift+Left/Right: Word select\n- Home/End: Line start/end\n- Ctrl+Home/End: File start/end\n- Alt+Tab: Switch windows\n\n**Multi-Cursor Workflow:**\n1. Select target text\n2. Ctrl+Shift+L to select all occurrences\n3. Type the replacement\n4. Esc to exit multi-cursor\n\n**Hand Positioning:**\n- Left pinkie on Ctrl\n- Left ring/middle on Alt\n- Right hand on navigation keys","codeExamples":[{"id":"ex1","title":"Combo Practice","description":"Patterns that exercise modifier key combos","code":{"typing-speed":"copy this line and paste it below\ncopy this line and paste it below\n\nselect all and replace word with term\nselect all and replace word with term\n\nundo the change and redo it back again\nundo the change and redo it back again"},"explanation":"Practice these with actual Ctrl+C/V, Ctrl+Shift+L, Ctrl+Z/Y flows."}]}],
      quiz: { questions: [{"id":"q1","type":"mcq","question":"What does Ctrl+Shift+L do in VS Code?","options":["Select current line","Select all occurrences","Toggle sidebar","Open terminal"],"correctAnswer":"Select all occurrences","explanation":"Ctrl+Shift+L selects all matching occurrences for multi-cursor editing.","difficulty":2}], passingScore: 70 },
      cheatSheet: [{"label":"Ctrl+C/V","value":"Copy/Paste"},{"label":"Ctrl+Shift+L","value":"Select all occurrences"},{"label":"Alt+Tab","value":"Switch windows"}]
