      id: "ts-39", number: 39, title: "Code Typing Arena", subtitle: "Competitive coding typing matches", difficulty: "Expert", estimatedMinutes: 55, xpReward: 75, prerequisites: [], learningObjectives: ["Compete in code-specific typing", "Master coding speed under pressure", "Handle syntax-heavy passages"], partLabel: "Part 5: Real Projects + Challenges",
      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Code Typing Competition","whyItMatters":"Code typing is fundamentally different from prose typing. Symbols, indentation, and case sensitivity add complexity.","content":"**Code vs Prose Typing:**\n- More shift key usage (symbols)\n- Exact whitespace matters\n- Case sensitivity\n- Non-alphabetic characters dominate\n\n**Code Passage Types:**\n- Short function (5-10 lines)\n- Algorithm solution\n- Configuration file\n- Markup (HTML/XML)\n- SQL query\n\n**Scoring Adjustments:**\n- Symbols weighted higher than letters\n- Indentation errors penalized\n- Brace matching checked\n- Case errors = full point deduction\n\n**Training Method:**\n1. 5 min: Warm-up with easy code\n2. 10 min: Medium code with various symbols\n3. 10 min: Hard code with nested structures\n4. 5 min: Sprint on algorithm\n\n**Arena Format:**\n- Both players get same code\n- First to finish with 95%+ accuracy wins\n- Tiebreaker: higher accuracy\n- Minimum speed: 40 WPM equivalent for code","codeExamples":[{"id":"ex1","title":"Code Arena","description":"Practice competitive code typing","code":{"typing-speed":"function fibonacci(n) {\n    if (n <= 1) return n;\n    const dp = [0, 1];\n    for (let i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n        dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + dp[i - 2];\n    }\n    return dp[n];\n}\n\nclass TreeNode {\n    constructor(val) {\n        this.val = val;\n        this.left = null;\n        this.right = null;\n    }\n}"},"explanation":"These are typical competitive programming code snippets. Type with flawless accuracy."}]}],
      quiz: { questions: [{"id":"q1","type":"mcq","question":"What is the minimum accuracy requirement for code typing competitions?","options":["85%","90%","95%","99%"],"correctAnswer":"95%","explanation":"Code competitions typically require 95%+ accuracy due to syntax sensitivity.","difficulty":3}], passingScore: 70 },
      cheatSheet: [{"label":"Code WPM","value":"Adjusted for symbols vs letters"},{"label":"Symbol Weight","value":"Symbols count more than letters"},{"label":"Indentation","value":"Whitespace precision in code typing"}]
