      sections: [{"id":"s1","title":"Final Mastery Assessment","whyItMatters":"This final assessment proves you have achieved professional-level typing speed and accuracy across all domains.","content":"**Certification Requirements:**\n- Minimum 60 WPM on prose\n- Minimum 50 WPM on code\n- 95%+ accuracy on all tests\n- Complete all assessment modules\n- Pass with combined score of 80%+\n\n**Assessment Modules:**\n\n**Module 1 — Prose (25%):**\n- 5-minute typing test\n- General English passage\n- Min 60 WPM at 95% accuracy\n\n**Module 2 — Code (25%):**\n- Type 3 code snippets\n- JavaScript, Python, HTML/CSS\n- Min 50 WPM at 95% accuracy\n\n**Module 3 — Accuracy (25%):**\n- 3-minute no-error challenge\n- Delete key disabled\n- Start over on any error\n- Must complete within 4 minutes\n\n**Module 4 — Speed (25%):**\n- 1-minute max speed burst\n- Any accuracy above 90%\n- Min 80 WPM peak\n\n**Certificate Includes:**\n- Typing Speed Certification\n- Final WPM and accuracy\n- Date of completion\n- Unique certificate ID\n- Verified by platform","codeExamples":[{"id":"ex1","title":"Final Assessment","description":"Type the final certification passage","code":{"typing-speed":"Congratulations on reaching the final typing assessment!\nThis passage represents the culmination of your training.\nYou have learned touch typing, finger placement, and muscle memory.\nYou have mastered coding symbols, brackets, and syntax patterns.\nYou have built endurance, accuracy, and competitive skills.\nNow it is time to prove your mastery with this final test.\nType at your best pace with confidence and precision.\nEvery keystroke represents hours of dedicated practice.\n\nconst mastery = { wpm: 60, accuracy: 95, endurance: true };\nconst certificate = await issueCertificate({\n    userId: currentUser.id,\n    finalWpm: mastery.wpm,\n    finalAccuracy: mastery.accuracy\n});\nconsole.log('🎉 Typing Master Achieved!', certificate);"},"explanation":"This is the final certification passage — a mix of prose and code. Type with confidence!"}]}],
